{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["The Dandelion is found via ",["l","采集","foraging"]," in the ",["l","春季","Spring"],", or grown from ",["l","春季种子","Spring Seeds"],". Up to ten can be purchased from ",["l","皮埃尔","Pierre"]," at the ",["l","花舞节","Flower Dance"],". Up to five can also be purchased from ",["l","卡洛琳","Caroline"],"'s ",["l","沙漠节","shop"]," at the ",["l","沙漠节","Desert Festival"]," for 10 Calico Eggs ",["l","卡利科三花蛋","Calico Egg"],"s each. It can randomly be found in ",["l","垃圾桶","Garbage Can"],"s during Spring. Although it is a flower in its description (and in real life), the game classifies it as \"Forage\" and not \"Flower.\""]]]],["Gifting",2,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Like"]},[["l","莱纳斯","Linus"],", ",["l","皮埃尔","Pierre"],", ",["l","潘妮","Penny"],", ",["l","莉亚","Leah"],", ",["l","哈维","Harvey"]]],[{"h":1,"v":["Neutral"]},[["l","罗宾","Robin"],", ",["l","德米特里厄斯","Demetrius"],", ",["l","玛鲁","Maru"],", ",["l","阿比盖尔","Abigail"],", ",["l","肯特","Kent"],", ",["l","亚历克斯","Alex"],", ",["l","艾芙琳","Evelyn"],", ",["l","刘易斯","Lewis"],", ",["l","克林特","Clint"],", ",["l","潘姆","Pam"],", ",["l","艾米丽","Emily"],", ",["l","玛妮","Marnie"],", ",["l","格斯","Gus"],", ",["l","桑迪","Sandy"]]],[{"h":1,"v":["Dislike"]},[["l","塞巴斯蒂安","Sebastian"],", ",["l","卡洛琳","Caroline"],", ",["l","海莉","Haley"],", ",["l","贾斯","Jas"],", ",["l","文森特","Vincent"],", ",["l","山姆","Sam"],", ",["l","谢恩","Shane"],", ",["l","艾利欧特","Elliott"],", ",["l","矮人","Dwarf"],", ",["l","法师","Wizard"],", ",["l","威利","Willy"],", ",["l","科罗布斯","Krobus"],", ",["l","雷欧","Leo"]]],[{"h":1,"v":["Hate"]},[["l","乔治","George"],", ",["l","乔迪","Jodi"]]]]]]],["Recipes",2,[]],["Cooking",3,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Name"]},{"h":1,"v":["Description"]},{"h":1,"v":["Ingredients"]},{"h":1,"v":["Energy / Health"]},{"h":1,"v":["Recipe Source(s)"]},{"h":1,"v":["Sell Price"]}],[[["l","沙拉","Salad"]],["A healthy garden salad."],[["i","(O)20","Leek ×1"],["i","(O)22","Dandelion ×1"],["i","(O)419","Vinegar ×1"]],["Energy 113\nHealth 50"],[["l","艾米丽","Emily"]," (Mail - 3+ ❤)"